{"id":"MOEX-112100-2301-Q056","title":"Cyclosporine：T細胞轉錄訊號與腎毒性","version":"integration-v2 after accepted tone/teaching patches","batch":"112-2-med2-q51-100","sourceSha256":"c5de8c0e3af4773e0acd1361654bb14a217102f090c6e3e4dddfcffab1615597","shortHtml":"<p><strong>選C。</strong>Cyclosporine的經典免疫抑制路徑，是阻斷<strong>calcineurin—活化T細胞核因子（NFAT）訊號，降低介白素2（interleukin-2，IL-2）的轉錄與產生</strong>，抑制T細胞活化。原選項寫的是介白素1（IL-1）；本題依經典路徑辨識IL-2。</p>","html":"<h2>Cyclosporine：T細胞轉錄訊號與腎毒性</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：C</p><h3>錯在把介白素2換成介白素1</h3>\n<p><strong>選C。</strong>Cyclosporine的經典免疫抑制路徑，是阻斷<strong>calcineurin—活化T細胞核因子（NFAT）訊號，降低介白素2（interleukin-2，IL-2）的轉錄與產生</strong>，抑制T細胞活化。原選項寫的是介白素1（IL-1）；本題依經典路徑辨識IL-2。</p>\n<h3>A、B其實是同一條路徑的上下游</h3>\n<p>正常T細胞接受刺激後，細胞內鈣離子訊號促進<strong>鈣調神經磷酸酶（calcineurin）</strong>活化。它具有蛋白質磷酸酶功能，能使<strong>活化T細胞核因子（nuclear factor of activated T cells，NFAT；原題寫NF-AT）去磷酸化</strong>，有利NFAT進入細胞核，調節IL-2等基因的轉錄。</p>\n<p>Cyclosporine先與細胞內的<strong>cyclophilin（親環蛋白）</strong>結合，形成的複合體抑制calcineurin。因此，<strong>A的酵素活性受抑制，接著B的轉錄因子作用下降</strong>。受抑制的是磷酸酶功能，因而減少NFAT去磷酸化與後續核內作用。</p>\n<h3>D：腎毒性與高血壓的臨床線索</h3>\n<p><strong>腎毒性與高血壓都是重要不良反應。</strong>仿單因此要求關注腎功能與血壓。這兩個毒性線索與calcineurin抑制劑的藥理分類一致。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1658px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.6207233626588464\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/92846b5d2a46cde7302da6efccfd76ad028267ee45e7662d8e4adf039d22bcad.png\" alt=\"鈣離子、calcineurin與NFAT訊號，圖中標示cyclosporin A及FK506抑制calcineurin\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1658\" height=\"1023\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/92846b5d2a46cde7302da6efccfd76ad028267ee45e7662d8e4adf039d22bcad.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>沿圖中央Ca²⁺→calcineurin→細胞核NFAT閱讀。</strong>右側紅色抑制線直接標出cyclosporin A；FK506是tacrolimus的別名。圖中ER為內質網、TCR為T細胞受體；CRAC是鈣釋放活化鈣通道，STIM1是內質網鈣感測蛋白。圖中不同抑制位置作為路徑背景；NFAT進核後的IL-2轉錄作用可接回上文。Park、Yoo、Kim、Kim，<em>Frontiers in Immunology</em> 2020，Figure 3，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 4.0</a>；原圖等比例呈現。</figcaption></figure>\n\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與圖文查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部正式原題（卷碼2301）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本科最後更正：Q69最終一律給分；其餘依更正答鍵</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=aaf79e72-26bf-4152-9cd1-10d8c30fa4fe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DailyMed cyclosporine：IL-2、腎毒性與高血壓</a></li><li><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.3389/fimmu.2020.00195\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Park等原刊：Ca²⁺—calcineurin—NFAT路徑及Figure 3</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cancer.gov/publications/dictionaries/cancer-drug/def/cyclosporine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCI cyclosporine：細胞內蛋白、calcineurin及T細胞抑制</a></li></ul></details>","imageCount":1,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：C"}